SUMMARY:Anberlin in Greensboro: Durham Field Trip Edition 🎸
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nI’m heading to Greensboro for Anbe
 rlin on 5/29 : and if you were an emotionally unstable millennial with a h
 oodie and side bangs at any point between 2004–2010… this may legally 
 count as therapy.\n\nSo if you’re already going\, thinking about going\,
  or wanted to go but didn’t want to make the trip solo\, let’s make it
  a little Durham-to-Greensboro emo field trip 🖤\n\nA night of dramatic 
 lyrics\, existential nostalgia\, and collectively pretending we don’t st
 ill know every word to The Feel Good Drag by muscle memory alone.\n\nWe ca
 n meet there — or if we’re already homies\, we can carpool 🚗\n\nBon
 us points if:\n• your iPod once had a “driving at night” playlist\n
 • you survived the MySpace era emotionally damaged but funnier\n• you 
 still think Anberlin outros hit harder than most modern relationships\n\nL
 et’s scream lyrics in a crowd with the emotional intensity of a 2007 AIM
  away message.
